WEBVTT

00:56.115 --> 00:58.868
FILING FOR LOVE

01:07.334 --> 01:08.586
Did you break your heel?

01:09.503 --> 01:10.504
Yes.

01:10.754 --> 01:12.339
You're Director Oh's secretary,
right?

01:14.675 --> 01:16.385
What size are you?
We're wearing the same shoes.

01:25.102 --> 01:27.646
HAEMU GROUP
2022 REGULAR BOARD MEETING

01:30.691 --> 01:32.401
The human heart

01:33.444 --> 01:34.778
can be so fickle.

01:36.489 --> 01:38.240
I really was grateful.

01:52.838 --> 01:54.590
But the fact that hers was
a designer brand

01:55.382 --> 01:57.635
and mine were cheap knockoffs

01:58.802 --> 02:01.305
made me feel conflicted.

02:13.067 --> 02:15.194
- Hello.
- Yes, hello.

02:15.277 --> 02:18.155
Is Ms. Joo In-a not in today?

02:18.405 --> 02:19.698
She was transferred abroad.

02:19.990 --> 02:21.742
She won't be back for a while.

02:28.457 --> 02:31.043
She had taken one of my knockoffs.

02:32.670 --> 02:34.255
I wonder how she felt about it.

02:35.381 --> 02:37.466
This request is from Finance.

02:37.550 --> 02:39.468
They are customary expenses.

02:39.552 --> 02:41.595
You only need to take a brief look
before you approve it.

02:41.679 --> 02:42.763
I'll read it through.

02:43.097 --> 02:44.640
Not all customs are appropriate.

02:46.183 --> 02:47.184
Right.

02:49.478 --> 02:50.980
You can sign the form with this...

03:06.912 --> 03:08.122
Your shoes are nice.

03:09.832 --> 03:10.833
Pardon?

03:14.044 --> 03:15.087
Never mind.

03:15.796 --> 03:16.880
If only

03:17.798 --> 03:19.967
I had known then what that meant

03:20.593 --> 03:22.720
I wouldn't have fallen for him.

03:26.515 --> 03:29.310
They say great love
is akin to deep resentment.

03:29.393 --> 03:30.728
REPORTING MS. JOO IN-A

03:31.437 --> 03:33.480
Do I love Jeon Jae-yeol?

03:33.564 --> 03:34.732
...AND HER SUPERIOR, WHO IS MARRIED

03:34.815 --> 03:36.525
Or do I resent Joo In-a?

03:44.575 --> 03:45.659
SEND

03:46.285 --> 03:48.704
EMAIL WAS SENT SUCCESSFULLY

03:51.957 --> 03:55.711
EPISODE 10:
IRREVERSIBLE

03:56.545 --> 03:58.756
NEW MESSAGES

04:02.551 --> 04:03.719
NEW MESSAGES

04:03.802 --> 04:05.262
Is the rumor about Ms. Joo true?

04:05.346 --> 04:06.930
How's the atmosphere at work?

04:07.014 --> 04:08.766
Do you know anything about this?

04:44.968 --> 04:46.929
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

04:58.190 --> 04:59.316
Hello?

05:01.235 --> 05:02.236
Yes, sir.

05:05.823 --> 05:06.990
I understand.

05:12.663 --> 05:13.997
I'm all right

05:14.081 --> 05:15.833
but I don't think my higher-ups are.

05:18.293 --> 05:19.586
I have to go upstairs.

05:36.311 --> 05:39.648
Listen up. You must have
a lot to talk about.

05:40.482 --> 05:42.860
It must be frustrating
to keep sending messages.

05:43.694 --> 05:45.279
I'll be away for a meeting.

05:45.362 --> 05:50.325
Use your voice freely
and talk as much as you want.

05:51.201 --> 05:52.494
But once I return

05:53.495 --> 05:55.247
you must all focus on your tasks.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.001
Do you understand?

06:09.595 --> 06:11.764
J CONVALESCENT HOSPITAL

06:16.393 --> 06:17.770
Do you like this show that much?

06:21.732 --> 06:22.900
Your son is here.

06:22.983 --> 06:25.402
You've been staring
at the TV for hours.

06:51.053 --> 06:52.596
MISSED CALLS

06:52.679 --> 06:54.389
NEW MESSAGES

07:00.646 --> 07:02.105
REPORTING MS. JOO IN-A

07:02.189 --> 07:03.649
...AN INAPPROPRIATE
WORKPLACE RELATIONSHIP

07:07.277 --> 07:11.740
How could the audit head
find herself in such accusations?

07:11.824 --> 07:12.825
How are they accusations?

07:13.116 --> 07:14.993
They're just one-sided claims
by the email sender.

07:15.077 --> 07:17.246
But there's a photo for proof.

07:18.080 --> 07:19.748
What exactly is going on here?

07:20.833 --> 07:23.001
I'm greeting this person warmly.

07:23.710 --> 07:26.630
This isn't the US.
No one greets people like this here.

07:26.922 --> 07:30.509
Why would you say something
that awkward and old-fashioned?

07:31.009 --> 07:33.595
Let's forget all that
and cut to the chase.

07:34.012 --> 07:35.264
So who is it?

07:35.514 --> 07:38.141
Who's the man in the photo
that you exchanged greetings with?

07:50.779 --> 07:51.780
Jae-yeol.

08:00.038 --> 08:01.373
Long time no see.

08:01.874 --> 08:03.208
You're in my seat.

08:20.225 --> 08:22.769
Is this Ms. Joo's
disciplinary hearing or something?

08:23.562 --> 08:25.105
That's not it, sir.

08:25.188 --> 08:27.566
Then is the whole board
grilling an employee

08:27.649 --> 08:29.735
because of one spam email?

08:35.198 --> 08:36.366
Don't you have better things to do?

08:37.910 --> 08:40.078
This is more than enough cause
for an emergency meeting.

08:40.162 --> 08:42.372
The whole company's in uproar.

08:44.041 --> 08:46.793
We all got one malicious email
that doesn't even have much detail

08:47.127 --> 08:49.296
and the whole board convened
because of it.

08:49.922 --> 08:51.173
Isn't that ridiculous?

08:51.965 --> 08:53.592
This report isn't about just anyone.

08:53.675 --> 08:55.928
It's about our head of audit.

08:56.386 --> 09:00.557
Are you defending her because
you care about her more than average?

09:11.151 --> 09:13.153
Call the head of HR
to my office immediately.

09:18.033 --> 09:19.409
What impeccable timing.

09:20.077 --> 09:22.079
You refused to come in for days

09:22.162 --> 09:25.290
but then you show up as soon
as you hear Ms. Joo's in trouble.

09:28.251 --> 09:30.837
I'm saying
it's good to see you're back.

09:31.880 --> 09:33.590
I'll call HR right away.

09:37.928 --> 09:41.181
I believe the email was sent
to every employee's account.

09:41.807 --> 09:43.308
Search traffic for Ms. Joo

09:43.392 --> 09:46.311
as well as for most male executives
has increased significantly.

09:46.395 --> 09:49.189
I believe it's related
to this incident.

09:50.816 --> 09:51.942
Ms. Boo.

09:52.651 --> 09:55.570
Emails or posts like these
that comment on one's privacy...

09:55.779 --> 09:57.114
Yes, sir.

09:57.990 --> 10:01.243
It wouldn't be a problem
if the person followed protocol

10:01.326 --> 10:03.078
and contacted the Audit Team.

10:03.578 --> 10:06.081
But I believe widespread exposure

10:06.164 --> 10:08.417
such as this instance,
could carry legal repercussions.

10:09.251 --> 10:10.335
Am I right?

10:11.670 --> 10:13.255
Well, yes.

10:13.338 --> 10:17.884
The person emailed the whole company,
so whether it's true or not

10:18.176 --> 10:20.053
it could be grounds for defamation.

10:21.221 --> 10:24.057
If the email was sent
from the outside to all employees

10:24.725 --> 10:27.686
it means it's possible
the email list was leaked.

10:27.769 --> 10:31.523
For security purposes,
we should track the sender.

10:32.190 --> 10:34.901
Right. I'll get IT
and the Information Office

10:34.985 --> 10:36.278
to trace the sender's IP.

10:36.361 --> 10:38.238
Call me as soon as you get something.

10:38.321 --> 10:39.531
Yes, sir.

11:04.598 --> 11:06.433
Are you heading home, Ms. Joo?

11:11.396 --> 11:13.565
Is the food to your liking?

11:15.525 --> 11:16.777
Of course, it is.

11:16.943 --> 11:18.445
Rice is our staple food.

11:20.739 --> 11:21.907
You smile easily.

11:23.325 --> 11:25.827
So why are you so stiff
in that photo?

11:26.119 --> 11:27.996
You said it was a warm greeting.

11:29.748 --> 11:31.374
You shouldn't jump to conclusions

11:31.750 --> 11:33.752
based on a photo taken
in a split second.

11:35.712 --> 11:38.548
I can and will make
whatever conclusion I want.

11:38.632 --> 11:39.633
My status allows it.

11:42.302 --> 11:45.472
Whether this will end
as a random incident

11:46.473 --> 11:48.600
or turn into a scandal

11:48.934 --> 11:51.103
all depends on what you say next.

11:56.650 --> 11:59.486
I've been watching you, Ms. Joo.

12:00.112 --> 12:03.949
I noticed at the workshop
that you'll never side with me.

12:04.032 --> 12:06.576
But it doesn't look like
you're on Jae-yeol's side either.

12:08.161 --> 12:11.706
Don't you think it's time
to make your intentions clear?

12:17.254 --> 12:18.713
If I take this shot

12:19.005 --> 12:21.842
does that mean I vow
to be loyal to you or something?

12:22.926 --> 12:26.012
I'd love to have
a big sister like you.

12:29.808 --> 12:31.518
If you know I'm older

12:32.185 --> 12:34.229
then you shouldn't
threaten me like this.

12:36.857 --> 12:39.568
You took it as a threat.
That's a shame.

12:40.527 --> 12:41.945
I hoped you'd take it
as a suggestion.

12:42.779 --> 12:43.822
In that case...

12:45.866 --> 12:47.951
It's a suggestion I must pass on.

12:50.370 --> 12:52.831
What a pity. The drink looked tasty.

12:53.123 --> 12:54.166
Instead

12:54.708 --> 12:55.834
I'll pay for dinner.

13:10.348 --> 13:11.391
I see

13:12.726 --> 13:14.227
she doesn't take me seriously.

13:32.537 --> 13:35.749
HEAD OF AUDIT

13:35.832 --> 13:37.125
AUDIT TEAM HEAD JOO IN-A

13:37.209 --> 13:38.335
Can I help you?

13:39.044 --> 13:40.086
Excuse us, Ms. Joo.

13:44.883 --> 13:46.176
What do you think you're doing?

13:46.259 --> 13:48.261
You can't do this.
She's the Head of Audit.

13:49.888 --> 13:53.350
Company regulations say
this is my team's job.

13:53.767 --> 13:55.018
This is a refreshing turn of events.

13:55.727 --> 13:57.479
We have Vice President
Jeon Sung-yeol's order

13:57.729 --> 14:01.399
to thoroughly investigate
the email we received about you.

14:01.942 --> 14:05.070
As you are mentioned in the email

14:05.153 --> 14:07.906
VP Jeon Sung-yeol's office
will carry out the investigation.

14:22.545 --> 14:23.546
What?

14:27.759 --> 14:28.760
What's going on?

14:30.220 --> 14:33.348
I guess I fell victim
to company politics.

14:34.849 --> 14:36.851
VP Jeon Sung-yeol hates me.

14:37.185 --> 14:40.105
He said he won't let me off for this
unless I side with him.

14:41.189 --> 14:42.565
I said no, of course.

14:45.652 --> 14:47.570
Don't frown. You'll get wrinkles.

14:51.032 --> 14:53.076
You know this is all
about politics now, don't you?

14:53.743 --> 14:56.288
No amount of logic or fact will work.

14:56.871 --> 14:59.457
Clench your teeth and hang in there.
And when you think you can't...

15:00.625 --> 15:01.626
When you can't...

15:02.669 --> 15:03.670
Then...

15:05.463 --> 15:06.464
Then what?

15:08.925 --> 15:11.469
Are you going to save me
like a knight in shining armor?

15:12.304 --> 15:13.513
Shall I?

15:15.307 --> 15:16.725
I'm afraid you'll actually do that.

15:18.268 --> 15:21.479
Don't worry. My career spans years.

15:22.188 --> 15:23.773
If this is how he acts

15:24.399 --> 15:27.319
I should come up
with something more strategic.

15:28.653 --> 15:29.821
What kind of strategy?

15:31.072 --> 15:33.616
You said this is you
greeting someone.

15:34.284 --> 15:35.535
Yes, that is true.

15:37.829 --> 15:41.916
Take another good look
at the photo and tell me

15:42.459 --> 15:44.169
who that person is.

15:50.050 --> 15:51.801
Gosh. I can't say.

15:53.053 --> 15:54.596
Who was this?

15:54.679 --> 15:56.556
Are you saying
you can't remember who it is

15:57.015 --> 15:58.683
you greeted that warmly?

15:58.767 --> 16:00.352
It's not that I can't remember.

16:01.478 --> 16:04.272
I greet so many people
in this manner.

16:04.564 --> 16:06.358
I can't tell everyone apart.

16:07.233 --> 16:09.736
I had just returned
from a long stint abroad.

16:10.070 --> 16:12.614
I greeted everyone I met like this.

16:12.697 --> 16:14.699
It's like a western-style greeting.

16:15.241 --> 16:16.284
You must know

16:16.368 --> 16:18.411
this is how people
greet each other abroad.

16:18.495 --> 16:20.205
I got so used to that custom.

16:20.747 --> 16:23.083
It took me a while to rediscover
my Confucian roots.

16:26.628 --> 16:27.796
Ms. Joo.

16:28.296 --> 16:29.631
Do you think this is a joke?

16:32.342 --> 16:34.886
Mr. Kim Deok-chul.

16:35.512 --> 16:37.138
I applaud the attempt

16:37.222 --> 16:39.391
but if you want
to intimidate someone...

16:42.685 --> 16:44.646
It's all about the sound effects.

16:46.689 --> 16:47.982
Get it?

16:55.907 --> 16:58.451
Do you think she'll be okay?

16:59.828 --> 17:01.996
The guys from the VP's office
will be tough on her.

17:02.622 --> 17:04.874
She's nothing but ego.
I wonder how she's doing.

17:05.458 --> 17:09.045
Am I the only one
who can't accept this?

17:09.295 --> 17:11.131
I get that they work for the VP

17:11.214 --> 17:13.716
but was there ever a precedent
where they investigated someone?

17:13.800 --> 17:15.218
If an investigation's needed

17:15.301 --> 17:18.680
they should form a task force team
to carry it out properly.

17:19.097 --> 17:21.641
I know he's the vice president,
this feels way out of...

17:29.065 --> 17:30.817
He crossed the line

17:31.234 --> 17:32.235
a lot.

17:32.318 --> 17:37.407
If levelheaded Mr. Noh is this upset
it means it's unreasonable.

17:37.782 --> 17:39.367
It is a bit weird.

17:39.951 --> 17:42.412
The email is pretty vague.

17:42.662 --> 17:45.999
It was a personal attack.
I don't see why it's such a big deal.

17:50.295 --> 17:51.337
So what?

17:52.338 --> 17:55.967
Will you all go over to complain
as you did for Mr. Moo?

17:56.050 --> 17:59.304
This isn't anything like that time.

17:59.387 --> 18:01.556
Anyone can tell this got political.

18:01.931 --> 18:04.142
Nothing we do will mean anything.

18:04.225 --> 18:06.186
We'll only get caught
in the crossfire.

18:06.269 --> 18:07.270
Still...

18:07.812 --> 18:10.315
not doing anything
makes me feel uncomfortable.

18:10.398 --> 18:12.233
Goodness.

18:12.317 --> 18:14.777
Do you think there's a way
to show how we feel?

18:14.861 --> 18:17.822
"We're behind you
and we support you."

18:17.906 --> 18:18.907
Something like that.

18:23.870 --> 18:25.872
I'll see you again tomorrow.

18:36.299 --> 18:38.009
Why are you all up here?

18:38.092 --> 18:40.011
Ms. Joo, aren't you hungry?

18:40.803 --> 18:43.723
Come with us.
Let's have a nice dinner.

18:50.021 --> 18:53.149
Hae-young was generous enough
to book a snow crab restaurant.

18:54.025 --> 18:57.237
These are nice and fleshy
because it's crab season.

18:57.320 --> 19:00.532
- Gosh, yes.
- Ms. Joo, this leg is packed.

19:00.615 --> 19:02.659
- Eat it up.
- No, the shell's better.

19:02.742 --> 19:04.661
Dip it in some ssamjang.

19:04.744 --> 19:06.371
- You need water.
- Ginger, too.

19:06.454 --> 19:08.706
- Where's the broth?
- Have some salad, too.

19:08.790 --> 19:10.250
What has gotten into you all?

19:11.376 --> 19:13.836
It feels like this is
my first birthday bash

19:13.920 --> 19:15.463
and I must put on a show for you.

19:15.547 --> 19:17.715
- Oh, gosh.
- That's not it.

19:18.091 --> 19:19.133
We're being silly.

19:20.426 --> 19:24.347
I know you organized this dinner
to cheer me up.

19:26.307 --> 19:27.642
I'm touched.

19:28.977 --> 19:29.978
Well...

19:30.687 --> 19:34.566
You're our fence and shelter
that keeps us safe.

19:34.983 --> 19:37.735
We need that fence and shelter
to stand tall to survive.

19:37.819 --> 19:40.613
I thought you weren't interested
in working at Haemu for much longer.

19:41.406 --> 19:43.658
He must want to stay for a long time
and embezzle as much as he can.

19:43.741 --> 19:45.410
Do you have to put it like that?

19:45.743 --> 19:46.869
It's not that.

19:47.161 --> 19:49.539
My kids are still young

19:49.622 --> 19:52.750
and I'm not sure if I ever can,
but I want to buy a house in Seoul.

19:53.418 --> 19:55.712
I put up with this kind of life
for a reason.

19:56.254 --> 19:57.630
My wife gives me

19:58.464 --> 19:59.841
just 200,000 won a month to spend.

19:59.924 --> 20:01.509
- Just 200,000 won?
- Yes.

20:01.926 --> 20:03.970
All breadwinner dads live like that.

20:04.387 --> 20:08.683
I plan to keep my job here
until my twins finish university.

20:08.766 --> 20:09.851
You should.

20:10.476 --> 20:13.187
Isn't it tough supporting
your boyfriend, Hae-young?

20:13.730 --> 20:15.898
No, well, it's not that bad.

20:15.982 --> 20:17.942
You're seeing someone?

20:18.026 --> 20:20.612
Yes, we've been dating for ten years.

20:20.695 --> 20:23.114
Are you still seeing that guy
who's into music?

20:23.197 --> 20:26.075
I told you to dump the guitarist
and find a golfer.

20:26.159 --> 20:28.536
Will you stop it?
I'd love to beat you up.

20:28.620 --> 20:30.038
You always do.

20:30.830 --> 20:32.165
What about you, Ms. Yoon?

20:32.540 --> 20:33.833
You're over-qualified and young, too.

20:33.916 --> 20:35.251
Don't you want a different job?

20:35.335 --> 20:36.419
No.

20:38.171 --> 20:40.965
I think all companies are the same.

20:43.051 --> 20:44.052
And...

20:44.636 --> 20:45.762
I like our team.

20:50.266 --> 20:51.643
What did you just say?

20:53.645 --> 20:54.896
I said, I like our team.

20:56.898 --> 21:00.026
My heart skipped a beat.
Was I the only one?

21:00.109 --> 21:02.862
Mine did, too. To hear that
from someone like Ms. Yoon...

21:02.945 --> 21:04.614
It's even more touching.

21:08.242 --> 21:09.243
Okay.

21:09.702 --> 21:11.788
With Team Three's love and support

21:12.038 --> 21:14.415
I promise to stay strong
for as long as I can.

21:14.832 --> 21:15.917
Thank you.

21:17.043 --> 21:18.670
You called me a fence and a shelter.

21:19.170 --> 21:21.673
No, a wall and an embankment.

21:22.048 --> 21:23.675
A fortress that circles a town.

21:23.758 --> 21:25.385
I'll be an iron fortress! Let's go!

21:25.468 --> 21:26.761
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

21:27.470 --> 21:29.263
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

21:29.347 --> 21:31.224
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

21:31.307 --> 21:32.475
How reassuring.

21:35.269 --> 21:37.438
- Gosh.
- Perfect.

21:37.897 --> 21:38.981
- Enjoy yourselves.
- Sure.

21:39.065 --> 21:40.233
Dig in.

21:48.074 --> 21:49.534
- It's good.
- Right?

21:49.617 --> 21:50.785
Hey.

21:51.703 --> 21:52.829
Not me.

21:53.830 --> 21:54.956
It looks great.

21:56.040 --> 21:59.043
There's a studio apartment
in Mr. Jeon's name

21:59.335 --> 22:01.129
but no one seems to live there

22:01.212 --> 22:03.131
and he doesn't seem
to go there often either.

22:03.214 --> 22:05.091
A studio apartment? Goodness.

22:05.174 --> 22:06.426
However

22:06.676 --> 22:08.970
he did visit this apartment complex
a few times.

22:09.762 --> 22:11.597
I checked who lives there.

22:15.560 --> 22:17.645
- She works at...
- I know who it is.

22:19.522 --> 22:20.690
Joo In-a.

22:23.651 --> 22:25.153
Why did he go see her?

22:25.903 --> 22:26.946
What are you doing?

22:28.114 --> 22:29.323
What's wrong?

22:30.074 --> 22:33.369
Who is Ji-a that you got her
a Serfe limited edition ring?

22:33.786 --> 22:35.663
And you even brought it
to our new home.

22:36.205 --> 22:37.749
Is she your darling love?

22:40.376 --> 22:41.753
Don't... Hang on.

23:24.629 --> 23:25.922
Wait.

23:27.215 --> 23:29.258
So JIA did not stand for Ji-a
but Joo In-a's initials.

23:30.802 --> 23:32.512
All this time.

23:36.516 --> 23:39.101
- Good job.
- Thank you, sir.

24:17.515 --> 24:18.558
Ms. Yoon.

24:19.058 --> 24:20.518
Do you have something to say to me?

24:27.275 --> 24:28.442
No.

24:33.114 --> 24:34.323
What was that?

24:39.620 --> 24:41.706
Hello, this is Noh Ki-jun
of Audit Team Three.

24:42.832 --> 24:45.126
What is it? What's the matter?

24:45.209 --> 24:46.252
Come over here.

24:47.628 --> 24:49.547
I shouldn't be telling you this

24:50.256 --> 24:52.592
but I came over
because it makes zero sense.

24:56.137 --> 24:57.847
You know, the email about Ms. Joo...

24:58.306 --> 25:00.391
My team tracked
the sender's IP address.

25:00.474 --> 25:03.102
So who does it belong to?
Who sent something like that?

25:04.687 --> 25:05.688
You did.

25:06.314 --> 25:08.816
- What?
- The sender's IP address

25:08.900 --> 25:10.860
was traced to your home, Ki-jun.

25:11.152 --> 25:12.778
I just can't believe it.

25:13.779 --> 25:16.866
Did you send it
because you hated her guts?

25:17.533 --> 25:19.368
For demoting you to handle PM cases?

25:21.537 --> 25:22.622
Hang on...

25:27.668 --> 25:28.961
The sender's location

25:29.503 --> 25:32.673
was traced to Mr. Noh Ki-jun's home.

25:42.516 --> 25:44.143
It's time to go, sir.

26:13.464 --> 26:16.926
NOH KI-JUN

26:26.435 --> 26:28.938
You have a lunch meeting
with Director Hwang

26:29.021 --> 26:31.023
before the conference
tomorrow afternoon.

26:31.107 --> 26:32.650
The traffic will be hectic.

26:33.693 --> 26:36.320
Shall I call the director
to change the restaurant?

26:41.450 --> 26:44.620
NOH KI-JUN

26:47.999 --> 26:49.000
Why don't you just take it?

26:50.459 --> 26:52.378
No, sir. It can wait.

26:54.422 --> 26:56.507
It looks like it's a call
you must take right now.

27:03.639 --> 27:05.307
Hi, what is it?

27:05.933 --> 27:07.643
Where are you? We need to talk.

27:08.102 --> 27:09.687
Not right now. Later on...

27:09.770 --> 27:10.938
Was it you?

27:11.647 --> 27:14.900
The email about Ms. Joo
was traced back to my home.

27:15.109 --> 27:16.110
Did you send it?

27:16.944 --> 27:18.988
The person
who sent the first email to me.

27:19.530 --> 27:20.531
That was you, wasn't it?

27:21.115 --> 27:22.783
Park A-jeong, why on earth did you...

27:22.867 --> 27:23.993
What were you think...

27:50.519 --> 27:51.562
Why did you do it?

27:52.271 --> 27:53.481
How did it look?

27:54.148 --> 27:55.691
You saw how you look together.

27:56.942 --> 27:59.278
Objectively speaking,
do you still think it's special?

28:00.279 --> 28:02.198
- What?
- I wanted you to see it.

28:02.615 --> 28:05.618
The love that you believe
is noble and special.

28:05.993 --> 28:09.872
It's no different from my feelings
that you disregard and dismiss.

28:09.955 --> 28:12.750
If you were angry with me,
you should've taken it out on me.

28:13.042 --> 28:15.711
- Why go after In-a...
- What is she to you?

28:16.879 --> 28:18.589
Don't you see me? I'm right here.

28:19.632 --> 28:22.009
Why does it have to be Joo In-a
and not me?

28:30.684 --> 28:32.353
I think this is it for us.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.606
Ms. Park.

28:36.524 --> 28:37.525
You're fired.

28:40.736 --> 28:43.531
Do I mean that little to you?

28:43.906 --> 28:45.366
Whatever you were,
you're not even that now.

28:48.953 --> 28:50.162
I'm sorry.

28:51.789 --> 28:53.332
It's me.

28:54.750 --> 28:57.586
I was the one
who always had eyes just for you.

28:57.837 --> 29:00.965
You pushed me away
like my feelings meant nothing.

29:01.048 --> 29:03.551
I just did it out of resentment.

29:05.219 --> 29:07.513
I know it was bad and wrong.

29:10.057 --> 29:12.268
Please don't abandon me.

29:43.841 --> 29:45.801
Good morning, Ms. Joo.

29:47.094 --> 29:49.471
What brings the busy vice president
who has no time to spare

29:49.555 --> 29:51.390
to come here in person?

29:55.895 --> 29:56.896
You're just as I thought.

29:57.521 --> 29:59.398
You're head of audit for a reason.

29:59.481 --> 30:01.984
My team couldn't get to you at all.

30:03.611 --> 30:04.695
Is that so?

30:05.946 --> 30:08.407
You seem to be
hanging in there pretty well.

30:09.074 --> 30:12.786
I know one trick I can use
to break people like you.

30:14.330 --> 30:15.414
It's finding your weakness.

30:17.291 --> 30:18.834
My weakness?

30:19.168 --> 30:21.629
I doubt you can find anything.

30:25.007 --> 30:28.010
You had a lovely dinner
after yesterday's interview

30:28.093 --> 30:29.303
with Team Three.

30:30.054 --> 30:31.138
What did you eat?

30:31.847 --> 30:34.516
Barbecue is boring, isn't it?

30:37.937 --> 30:39.563
What is your point exactly?

30:40.022 --> 30:43.275
I was told you
and Team Three had a great time.

30:43.359 --> 30:47.529
I wanted to know more about them,
so I read their personnel files.

30:50.658 --> 30:51.700
They're a mess.

30:53.410 --> 30:56.497
It's a miracle
Mr. Moo still has his job.

30:56.580 --> 30:59.250
And it's pure luck
that Mr. Cha was never penalized.

30:59.750 --> 31:02.044
Ms. Yoon's peers say
she's dreadful to work with.

31:03.921 --> 31:05.589
I'm thinking of calling HR

31:06.131 --> 31:09.426
to sort out Audit Team Three.

31:17.768 --> 31:18.769
How's that?

31:19.728 --> 31:20.896
Didn't I do pretty well

31:21.647 --> 31:22.648
in finding your weakness?

31:49.800 --> 31:51.719
You haven't changed,
leaving whenever you face trouble.

31:52.803 --> 31:55.472
It's now weird for us
to live under the same roof.

31:58.058 --> 31:59.143
Hey.

32:01.520 --> 32:03.272
I let you in because it was you

32:03.355 --> 32:05.274
when you suddenly barged in,
saying you had nowhere to go.

32:05.983 --> 32:09.737
For someone like you, who's so proud
and hates showing weakness

32:10.279 --> 32:12.781
I figured you must've had a reason
to come to me.

32:13.282 --> 32:15.617
That was why I let you in
without asking you anything.

32:16.994 --> 32:18.078
But...

32:21.290 --> 32:23.625
is this why you came to my house
in the first place?

32:23.709 --> 32:25.502
It's true I didn't have
anywhere else to go.

32:28.589 --> 32:30.215
And yes, there was a bit of a plan.

32:39.308 --> 32:40.642
This situation

32:41.268 --> 32:43.479
isn't advantageous
for Mr. Jeon Jae-yeol either.

32:44.146 --> 32:46.148
You said he was someone you loved.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.941
How can you do this if you love him?

32:48.025 --> 32:51.111
What you call love must be different
from what I call love.

32:51.195 --> 32:52.946
I can do even worse things!

33:00.371 --> 33:02.081
Thanks for everything.

33:02.956 --> 33:03.999
Take care.

33:28.482 --> 33:31.151
JOO IN-A

33:45.165 --> 33:47.167
Ms. Joo.

33:54.633 --> 33:55.801
Mr. Noh.

33:56.176 --> 33:57.219
Hey.

33:57.636 --> 33:58.720
Are you all right?

34:12.860 --> 34:14.236
Aren't I heavy?

34:16.321 --> 34:17.531
So light.

34:17.990 --> 34:19.658
You feel way too light.

34:21.452 --> 34:22.828
No, I'm heavy.

34:24.329 --> 34:25.998
Do you hate me because I'm so heavy?

34:27.499 --> 34:29.376
You really aren't heavy.

34:30.169 --> 34:32.004
But I'll hate you
if you drink this much.

34:35.215 --> 34:36.800
Don't hate me.

34:42.931 --> 34:45.642
Mr. Cha has to buy a home.

34:46.977 --> 34:50.355
Mr. Moo's kids
have to go to college, too.

34:51.648 --> 34:55.194
And Ms. Pyun needs
to marry her boyfriend.

34:58.739 --> 35:00.032
Are you crying?

35:00.824 --> 35:02.576
What? No.

35:08.207 --> 35:09.374
By any chance

35:10.792 --> 35:14.755
did Vice President Jeon Sung-yeol
blackmail you using our team?

35:17.341 --> 35:18.509
I don't think

35:20.552 --> 35:22.346
Far from being an iron fortress

35:25.641 --> 35:28.101
I feel like
I've become a rotting fence.

36:16.525 --> 36:17.776
This is Noh Ki-jun calling.

36:18.318 --> 36:19.486
May I see you for a moment?

36:44.052 --> 36:45.512
Would you like a drink?

36:45.721 --> 36:47.848
No, I drove here.

36:57.441 --> 36:58.609
Is In-a

36:59.943 --> 37:00.986
all right?

37:01.445 --> 37:02.863
If you're that worried

37:04.364 --> 37:05.949
it'd be more productive
for you to think of a way

37:06.033 --> 37:07.993
to patch up this incident.

37:11.455 --> 37:15.417
I heard the company tracked
the sender's IP to my house.

37:15.500 --> 37:17.461
I know it wasn't you.

37:18.420 --> 37:19.713
Just say I did it.

37:24.926 --> 37:27.512
I'll go to the disciplinary committee
and state I held a grudge against her

37:27.929 --> 37:29.806
for demoting me to the PM job
and tried to slander her.

37:29.890 --> 37:31.058
You cannot do that.

37:31.391 --> 37:32.809
Then do we tell the truth?

37:33.685 --> 37:35.062
Do we say that it was A-jeong?

37:35.854 --> 37:37.564
That'll expose her feelings for you

37:38.065 --> 37:39.816
and your relationship with Ms. Joo.

37:41.485 --> 37:42.486
They will all get exposed.

37:42.569 --> 37:44.237
Even so, that's still wrong.

37:45.280 --> 37:46.490
I'll pretend like I didn't hear it.

37:51.620 --> 37:52.704
Mr. Vice President.

37:57.042 --> 37:58.794
I'm doing this all for Ms. Joo.

38:05.425 --> 38:07.344
Then you will face
a disciplinary hearing, Mr. Noh.

38:08.470 --> 38:09.471
I don't care.

38:11.098 --> 38:14.142
It'll be much lighter
than the humiliation and dishonor

38:14.726 --> 38:16.186
she'll have to face
if I don't do this.

38:17.646 --> 38:18.647
On top of that

38:20.190 --> 38:22.859
I've never liked this company
even close to how much I like her.

38:52.723 --> 38:53.724
Yes, Se-young.

38:53.807 --> 38:55.392
Hey, you know
the disciplinary committee

38:55.475 --> 38:56.935
will be held at three o'clock, right?

38:57.644 --> 38:58.645
Yes.

38:59.146 --> 39:01.356
We'll have a testifier
make a statement first

39:01.982 --> 39:03.567
so come until four o'clock.

39:03.984 --> 39:05.193
A testifier?

39:06.653 --> 39:08.613
Who's the testifier
that's making a statement?

39:10.991 --> 39:14.202
The email sender decided to admit
that it was false information.

39:16.246 --> 39:17.330
Who's the sender?

39:18.081 --> 39:19.875
NOH KI-JUN

39:21.126 --> 39:24.212
The device is powered off.
You will be redirected to voicemail.

39:24.296 --> 39:25.297
After the beep...

39:31.386 --> 39:32.679
This is for the best.

39:33.472 --> 39:34.848
So please just make an order

39:35.432 --> 39:38.101
and have the disciplinary committee
summon me.

39:44.274 --> 39:45.901
Did you wish to see me,
Mr. Vice President?

39:45.984 --> 39:48.361
Ms. Joo's disciplinary committee
will be held today, correct?

39:48.945 --> 39:51.156
Yes, it's about to begin.

39:52.240 --> 39:54.493
There's no need
for you to be there yourself...

39:54.576 --> 39:55.577
No.

39:57.788 --> 39:58.914
I'll be there, too.

40:02.042 --> 40:06.296
Let us begin the disciplinary hearing
for Joo In-a, Head of Audit.

40:07.130 --> 40:10.801
The committee is here to deliberate
whether she violated

40:10.884 --> 40:13.845
the company regulations through
inappropriate personal conduct.

40:14.596 --> 40:16.515
Before we hear from Ms. Joo In-a

40:16.598 --> 40:20.018
we will hear from a testifier,
Mr. Noh Ki-jun

40:20.101 --> 40:22.395
regarding the email in question.

40:23.355 --> 40:24.981
I haven't heard about this.

40:25.524 --> 40:26.900
Why is Mr. Noh here?

40:26.983 --> 40:29.861
I apologize for not announcing
this matter beforehand.

40:30.362 --> 40:35.325
The IT Team in HR
tracked the sender's IP address.

40:36.284 --> 40:40.372
As a result, the one who sent
the email regarding Ms. Joo was...

40:48.547 --> 40:52.384
Ms. Joo, I thought I had notified you
to be here at 4 p.m.

40:53.760 --> 40:55.095
I'll take responsibility.

41:04.271 --> 41:06.147
I will take the responsibility
for everything...

41:06.231 --> 41:07.274
It was me.

41:14.614 --> 41:17.242
The man in the picture is me.

41:22.581 --> 41:23.915
Are you serious?

41:25.750 --> 41:27.168
What's going on between you two?

41:27.252 --> 41:30.130
Ms. Joo and I had dated in the past.

41:31.506 --> 41:33.258
However, after we separated
and I got married

41:33.466 --> 41:36.261
we have never been
in an inappropriate relationship.

41:38.805 --> 41:40.015
Then what were you doing there?

41:40.807 --> 41:42.017
Can you explain that?

41:49.149 --> 41:50.942
It was entirely my doing.

41:54.279 --> 41:55.822
I saw her
for the first time in a while

41:56.615 --> 41:57.782
and I faced emotions

41:58.783 --> 42:00.785
I didn't think
I still had left inside.

42:01.161 --> 42:02.329
So I made the mistake.

42:04.581 --> 42:05.790
She's actually the victim here.

42:08.001 --> 42:09.252
Ms. Joo

42:10.128 --> 42:13.548
did not do anything inappropriate.

42:29.314 --> 42:31.107
- It was the vice president.
- No way.

42:31.191 --> 42:33.193
- Seriously?
- What's going on, then?

42:35.612 --> 42:36.821
I can't believe this.

42:37.405 --> 42:38.615
I'm getting a headache right now.

42:38.907 --> 42:41.493
Ms. Joo truly is on another level.

42:41.576 --> 42:42.577
I mean, the vice president?

42:42.661 --> 42:44.829
But he said it wasn't
an inappropriate relationship.

42:44.913 --> 42:47.123
He also said
he had unresolved feelings.

42:47.749 --> 42:48.833
Isn't that considered cheating?

42:48.917 --> 42:50.835
How is that considered an affair?

42:50.919 --> 42:52.921
Emotional cheating
is also a form of an affair.

42:53.296 --> 42:56.424
If my boyfriend says
he's still hung up on his ex

42:56.508 --> 42:57.759
I'd break up with him then and there.

42:57.842 --> 42:59.678
But there were no actions taken.

42:59.761 --> 43:01.179
You can't really call it an affair.

43:01.262 --> 43:03.223
He did take action through a hug.

43:03.890 --> 43:05.934
Also, it was caught on camera.

43:06.017 --> 43:07.894
- Who knows what else they did?
- They didn't!

43:10.897 --> 43:13.566
I mean, why are you two still here?

43:13.900 --> 43:16.111
Why are you always chatting
in our area?

43:16.194 --> 43:17.988
If you want to do that,
volunteer to transfer here.

43:18.071 --> 43:19.322
You're here all the time

43:19.406 --> 43:21.866
so I'm not even sure whether
you two are on my team or not.

43:24.536 --> 43:26.454
The Audit Team... Gosh.

43:31.167 --> 43:32.210
Gosh.

43:32.919 --> 43:34.087
The vice president

43:34.796 --> 43:36.423
got to play the cool part all alone.

43:39.509 --> 43:41.678
Were you trying to be cool
by faking your statement?

43:43.304 --> 43:44.431
I heard everything.

43:44.764 --> 43:46.182
That you were planning to say

43:46.266 --> 43:48.977
that you sent
the wicked email out of spite.

43:49.477 --> 43:51.604
I thought that was the best
I could do in this situation.

43:52.313 --> 43:55.066
You were getting threatened
with that kind of nonsense

43:55.567 --> 43:57.068
so it was hard
to watch and do nothing.

43:57.360 --> 43:59.738
Did you think I'd sit and watch
if you said

44:00.613 --> 44:02.866
that you did something you didn't
because of me?

44:04.451 --> 44:06.327
This was the only thing I could do.

44:06.786 --> 44:09.873
I wanted to go this far
to protect you.

44:18.006 --> 44:19.716
I should stop getting in trouble.

44:20.300 --> 44:22.052
I might end up causing you trouble.

44:24.888 --> 44:25.889
Why?

44:26.097 --> 44:28.016
I liked how you called for me
when you were in trouble.

44:28.099 --> 44:29.517
You didn't even hesitate
to get on my back.

44:38.693 --> 44:40.612
- What is it?
- Give me a second.

44:41.071 --> 44:43.114
- Where are you going?
- Don't follow me.

44:51.790 --> 44:54.125
A-jeong, what's going on?

44:54.209 --> 44:55.460
Are you really quitting?

44:56.419 --> 44:58.296
It's so sudden.

44:59.339 --> 45:02.050
What am I going to do all alone
without you?

45:05.261 --> 45:06.513
Bye.

45:13.561 --> 45:14.604
A-jeong...

45:43.550 --> 45:45.051
So you do know what you did

45:45.802 --> 45:47.220
was worth a good slap.

45:52.225 --> 45:53.309
Why did you do that?

45:55.687 --> 45:57.105
It was an eyesore.

45:58.022 --> 45:59.107
All of you.

46:01.860 --> 46:02.902
Very explicit.

46:04.070 --> 46:06.531
So are you pleased
with this situation?

46:06.614 --> 46:07.824
I don't regret it.

46:08.408 --> 46:11.911
That precious love of yours
is now in shreds.

46:16.666 --> 46:18.168
But you're in shreds, too.

46:20.336 --> 46:21.546
Open your eyes

46:22.589 --> 46:24.215
and see who is falling apart.

46:32.182 --> 46:33.850
Are you out of your mind?

46:34.601 --> 46:36.019
Why did you step in?

46:37.061 --> 46:38.813
I'm doing my best to stop the news.
Don't worry.

46:38.897 --> 46:39.981
Keep your mouth shut!

46:40.732 --> 46:42.358
What do you think
your in-laws are going to do?

46:42.942 --> 46:44.736
What if they demand a divorce?

46:46.487 --> 46:47.697
Actually

46:48.781 --> 46:50.325
I had something to tell you.

46:51.951 --> 46:53.036
Who's there?

46:55.914 --> 46:57.165
It's me, Hyun-young.

46:58.416 --> 47:00.501
Hey, it's you, Hyun-young.

47:00.585 --> 47:01.920
Hello, Father.

47:02.295 --> 47:04.380
- Hyun-young.
- You were here, too.

47:08.301 --> 47:09.969
I heard everything out there.

47:10.511 --> 47:12.138
Are you furious, Father?

47:13.056 --> 47:15.975
You must be the one who's offended.

47:16.059 --> 47:18.311
My father has been
teaching him a lesson

47:18.394 --> 47:19.437
so don't be so harsh on him.

47:19.520 --> 47:21.147
No, I'm fine.

47:21.814 --> 47:23.566
I already knew

47:24.150 --> 47:25.818
about Ms. Joo and him.

47:26.778 --> 47:28.863
I told him to step up and be a man.

47:30.031 --> 47:32.492
It's so petty to stay quiet
while your ex-girlfriend

47:32.784 --> 47:33.952
is in trouble, don't you think?

47:36.621 --> 47:38.289
Look how chill she is about this.

47:38.373 --> 47:41.125
Jae-yeol, you have
one wonderful wife.

47:41.459 --> 47:42.710
Of course.

47:43.211 --> 47:44.587
I'm a member of the Sesan family.

47:49.801 --> 47:51.344
Anyway, that's that, Father.

47:52.553 --> 47:55.640
About the next development project
you're pushing with CPK.

47:56.266 --> 47:58.559
What do you think about Sesan
taking part in the consortium?

47:59.519 --> 48:00.853
Was that what you wanted to say?

48:01.813 --> 48:03.523
Is President Oh also aware?

48:03.940 --> 48:05.108
Of course.

48:05.191 --> 48:07.277
He wanted to make it extensive, too.

48:08.486 --> 48:10.738
Sesan's resources
and Haemu's technology

48:10.822 --> 48:13.658
should be enough to free the project
from CPK's influence.

48:13.741 --> 48:15.076
Yes, of course.

48:15.702 --> 48:17.412
All right. Then why don't we

48:18.037 --> 48:19.872
- set up a meeting with President Oh?
- But it does

48:20.498 --> 48:21.666
come with one condition.

48:29.257 --> 48:31.384
In the next general meeting

48:33.303 --> 48:34.345
appoint him publicly

48:35.471 --> 48:37.140
as the next president of the group.

48:38.891 --> 48:41.269
As President Jeon Jae-yeol.

48:58.911 --> 49:01.831
- What do you think you're doing?
- I'm trying to help you

49:02.081 --> 49:04.375
- and make you the successor.
- Yes, so why?

49:05.460 --> 49:07.378
- I told you already.
- That you want a divorce?

49:09.922 --> 49:11.174
Is that why

49:11.257 --> 49:13.509
you made that romantic announcement
in front of everyone?

49:15.136 --> 49:16.804
- That's...
- Freaking hilarious.

49:17.930 --> 49:19.182
One second.

49:20.350 --> 49:22.352
You gave me a dopamine rush.

49:24.187 --> 49:27.023
I couldn't believe you had
such romance in you, Jae-yeol.

49:28.733 --> 49:30.360
It's so intriguing.

49:32.028 --> 49:33.112
I...

49:34.655 --> 49:36.449
don't want to let you go anymore.

49:40.870 --> 49:42.163
Wait a second.

49:43.206 --> 49:44.582
Am I in love with Jeon Jae-yeol?

49:50.254 --> 49:51.714
- Hyun-young.
- Hubby.

49:54.008 --> 49:55.134
Dear husband!

49:55.718 --> 49:59.430
You can't afford
to defy me right now.

50:00.390 --> 50:03.267
I didn't just save you.

50:03.851 --> 50:05.353
I saved Joo In-a, too.

50:07.939 --> 50:09.482
You want to save her, don't you?

50:11.651 --> 50:12.693
That woman.

50:46.227 --> 50:48.104
Don't you think
our company is so much fun?

50:48.438 --> 50:50.857
The vice president himself
did an episode of EXchange for us.

50:52.024 --> 50:54.569
But talk
about Joo In-a's double standards.

50:54.652 --> 50:57.530
She's in the Audit Team
when she's dating the vice president.

50:57.613 --> 50:59.323
They aren't dating anymore.

50:59.782 --> 51:03.244
- They used to.
- You never know.

51:04.078 --> 51:07.039
Anyway, I've always been
suspicious of her.

51:07.331 --> 51:10.084
Her promotions came too early.
It must've been her looks.

51:11.002 --> 51:12.003
Oh, my.

51:12.753 --> 51:14.922
Is that supposed to be
a humiliation or a compliment?

51:15.006 --> 51:16.924
- Ms. Joo! I'm sorry.
- I'm sorry.

51:17.383 --> 51:18.634
I'm sorry.

51:18.718 --> 51:20.553
No, I was actually curious!

51:20.720 --> 51:23.055
What did you mean when you said
it must've been my looks?

51:23.973 --> 51:25.141
Ms. Joo.

51:25.766 --> 51:27.935
You don't have to mind them.
They aren't worth it.

51:30.229 --> 51:31.898
I'll buy you coffee.
Do you want an iced Americano?

51:31.981 --> 51:32.982
No.

51:33.357 --> 51:35.276
I'll buy my own strong coffee

51:35.359 --> 51:38.196
by adding two more shots
and down it quickly before I go up.

51:39.030 --> 51:40.865
You can go upstairs first, Mr. Noh.

51:51.834 --> 51:53.794
- Hello.
- Hey, Mr. Noh.

51:53.878 --> 51:54.879
You're here.

51:56.422 --> 51:59.300
What's so funny about all this?
They're all talking about Ms. Joo.

51:59.383 --> 52:00.676
Don't they have better things to do?

52:00.760 --> 52:02.303
Will she come to work today?

52:03.095 --> 52:04.514
I couldn't come if I were her.

52:04.597 --> 52:05.932
Why not?

52:06.015 --> 52:07.225
She was found innocent

52:07.308 --> 52:09.560
after the vice president
made that announcement.

52:09.644 --> 52:10.686
Exactly.

52:11.187 --> 52:13.272
It seemed like
he did that on purpose.

52:13.814 --> 52:14.899
It's kind of romantic.

52:15.900 --> 52:16.901
Romantic?

52:17.109 --> 52:20.154
Yesterday, you called it
emotional cheating and whatnot.

52:22.865 --> 52:23.866
What?

52:27.036 --> 52:28.246
Are you all right?

52:33.668 --> 52:34.669
Me?

52:40.675 --> 52:44.178
Hello, it's me, Joo In-a,
the talk of the town.

52:47.807 --> 52:49.350
I'm sure the mundane workplace

52:49.433 --> 52:51.143
must've been fun
for the last few days.

52:52.436 --> 52:54.146
All right, then.

52:54.564 --> 52:56.941
We're going back
to focused work mode.

52:57.441 --> 52:59.151
The general meeting is coming up.

52:59.819 --> 53:02.697
Mr. Ahn Min-su, I need the report
from the Audit Committee.

53:02.780 --> 53:03.781
Yes, ma'am.

53:17.086 --> 53:18.087
Father.

53:18.504 --> 53:20.214
You can't suddenly decide
on the successor

53:20.298 --> 53:22.341
because of Sesan's influence.

53:22.425 --> 53:24.135
Imagine how much Sesan will try
to control Haemu

53:24.218 --> 53:25.553
when Jae-yeol becomes the president.

53:25.636 --> 53:26.804
Be quiet!

53:27.054 --> 53:28.639
This is my decision to make.

53:29.390 --> 53:30.391
Father.

53:30.975 --> 53:34.186
His position at work isn't great
because of the scandal.

53:34.270 --> 53:36.022
It has hit rock bottom...

53:43.070 --> 53:46.866
VICE PRESIDENT JEON SUNG-YEOL

53:47.450 --> 53:50.369
Why?

53:51.203 --> 53:52.455
Damn it!

53:58.711 --> 53:59.795
Who's there?

54:02.965 --> 54:04.467
Should I come later?

54:05.801 --> 54:06.927
Hey, Doo-gi.

54:16.520 --> 54:20.441
It's about Haemu Pharmaceutical
you had mentioned before.

54:21.108 --> 54:24.445
During the forensics conducted on
Ms. Joo's computer for this incident

54:25.071 --> 54:27.406
the circumstances were spotted
that Haemu Pharmaceutical file

54:27.490 --> 54:29.158
was deleted on her computer.

54:29.909 --> 54:31.035
Ms. Joo?

54:31.118 --> 54:34.372
I'm not fully sure
what the file holds.

54:34.455 --> 54:37.333
But Vice President Jeon Jae-yeol
was a former president there

54:37.917 --> 54:42.338
and now we know he had a relationship
with Ms. Joo in the past.

54:43.673 --> 54:46.175
It didn't feel right
once I connected the dots.

55:04.902 --> 55:08.698
Jae-yeol must've held onto it,
no matter what it is.

55:11.367 --> 55:12.576
Is there anyone

55:13.536 --> 55:15.579
among his people
that we can win over?

55:20.000 --> 55:21.919
It's small but fully furnished

55:22.169 --> 55:23.838
so it's great if you wish
to move in right away.

55:23.921 --> 55:26.132
It won't be easy to find
a better place to rent.

55:30.761 --> 55:32.179
I'll take it.

55:33.681 --> 55:36.308
May I install
the double-latch myself?

55:36.392 --> 55:38.477
I'll let the landlord know
right away.

55:38.728 --> 55:40.563
Goodness, you're a young
and pretty lady

55:40.646 --> 55:42.857
so safety must be
your biggest concern.

55:43.315 --> 55:46.235
This neighborhood is quiet
and free from accidents.

55:46.902 --> 55:50.030
I see. I'll transfer
the holding deposit right now.

55:50.114 --> 55:51.323
Yes, sure.

55:57.663 --> 55:58.831
ACCOUNT HOLDER: PARK A-JEONG

55:58.914 --> 56:01.459
1,000,000 WON
NOT ENOUGH BALANCE

56:04.628 --> 56:07.339
- Your call cannot be connected.
- What did my brother do this time?

56:07.423 --> 56:09.175
Please leave a message
after the beep.

56:16.265 --> 56:17.308
Hello?

56:18.184 --> 56:20.352
- Is that you?
- Ms. Park?

56:28.110 --> 56:30.154
What do you want to say to me?

56:35.534 --> 56:36.702
Well...

56:37.411 --> 56:39.663
You knew about the relationship

56:40.456 --> 56:42.208
between my brother
and the Head of Audit, right?

56:43.959 --> 56:47.505
I mean, I could tell by the timing
that you must've been fired

56:47.922 --> 56:49.799
after calling him out frankly.

56:54.887 --> 56:57.681
That is not why I left.

56:57.973 --> 57:00.059
They weren't just dating.

57:00.684 --> 57:02.436
Their relationship affected
the company, too.

57:03.646 --> 57:04.688
Did you really not know?

57:05.105 --> 57:07.358
What do you mean?

57:07.441 --> 57:10.861
That is what I'm trying
to investigate in detail.

57:13.447 --> 57:14.573
May I

57:15.324 --> 57:17.785
ask for your help, Ms. Park?

57:23.374 --> 57:25.042
2025 HAEMU GROUP
GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS

57:25.125 --> 57:28.546
2025 HAEMU GROUP
GENERAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS

57:59.577 --> 58:02.037
Why should we be
at the general meeting?

58:02.121 --> 58:05.249
Other companies make
their employees sit in, too. Come on.

58:05.332 --> 58:07.877
You probably didn't know
because you were in Audit Team One

58:07.960 --> 58:10.170
but Audit Team Three
always took part in these events

58:10.254 --> 58:11.797
when they required manpower.

58:11.881 --> 58:13.632
We were pretty much
Filler Team Three.

58:13.716 --> 58:14.884
- Come on.
- Let's go.

58:15.301 --> 58:18.220
That concludes this year's
financial audit report.

58:23.934 --> 58:27.313
There is a special agenda
scheduled for today's meeting.

58:27.396 --> 58:30.858
President Jeon Moo-tae will step up
and share it with us.

58:30.941 --> 58:32.568
Mr. President, please.

58:38.741 --> 58:41.785
I am aware of many different opinions
regarding personnel matters

58:41.869 --> 58:44.204
and management conditions.

58:46.290 --> 58:48.918
I am here today

58:49.001 --> 58:51.545
to share an important decision
regarding my position.

58:52.922 --> 58:54.798
I, Jeon Moo-tae

58:55.174 --> 58:56.508
will step down
as president as of today.

58:58.677 --> 59:00.304
Going forward

59:00.387 --> 59:03.057
Haemu Group will face
an even fiercer business climate.

59:04.141 --> 59:06.101
A leader for the group

59:06.185 --> 59:08.646
should be someone
with principle and decisiveness

59:09.063 --> 59:12.566
someone who can protect
the organization firmly.

59:13.651 --> 59:15.069
Hence, the board of directors

59:17.655 --> 59:18.948
has recommended

59:19.531 --> 59:22.159
Vice President Jeon Jae-yeol
as the potential third president.

59:24.286 --> 59:25.579
I look forward to seeing

59:26.205 --> 59:27.247
your wise decisions.

59:31.168 --> 59:32.753
Thank you, Mr. President.

59:32.836 --> 59:35.214
Before we vote on appointing

59:35.297 --> 59:37.883
Vice President Jeon Jae-yeol
as the next president

59:37.967 --> 59:41.095
does anyone have
any questions or objections?

59:45.015 --> 59:47.059
- If there aren't any...
- I object.

59:51.397 --> 59:54.942
Is your objection
regarding the appointment

59:55.025 --> 59:56.777
of the next president?

59:59.738 --> 01:00:01.198
Yes, that is correct.

01:00:01.907 --> 01:00:05.285
Vice President Jeon Jae-yeol
does not qualify to be the president.

01:00:05.369 --> 01:00:06.370
Because

01:00:08.747 --> 01:00:12.126
he did something he shouldn't have

01:00:15.504 --> 01:00:18.340
and his ex-girlfriend,
the Head of Audit, covered it up.

01:00:20.259 --> 01:00:22.803
What do you mean?
Do you have evidence?

01:00:23.137 --> 01:00:25.097
Of course, evidence is important.

01:00:26.515 --> 01:00:28.892
Hence, I invited someone

01:00:28.976 --> 01:00:31.437
who will witness everything
with her own words.

01:00:32.479 --> 01:00:34.857
Someone who knows
President Jeon Jae-yeol

01:00:35.232 --> 01:00:36.900
the best.

01:02:19.545 --> 01:02:22.464
FILING FOR LOVE

01:02:50.576 --> 01:02:53.412
About Ms. Park's report...
How much of it is true?

01:02:53.495 --> 01:02:55.205
Bring Joo In-a down at all costs.

01:02:55.289 --> 01:02:56.665
What trick are you pulling again?

01:02:57.124 --> 01:02:59.042
In-a, just hand in your resignation.

01:03:00.377 --> 01:03:02.462
Mr. Noh, is this article about you?

01:03:02.546 --> 01:03:03.547
That you're her lover?

01:03:03.630 --> 01:03:05.007
You're the one who told me

01:03:05.382 --> 01:03:07.885
to take a good look
at who's really falling apart.

01:03:08.635 --> 01:03:11.388
Ki-jun seems to be
the one who's falling apart.

01:03:11.722 --> 01:03:12.764
I'm not making any settlements.

01:03:12.848 --> 01:03:14.474
I'll protect you until the end.

01:03:15.851 --> 01:03:17.686
No matter what I say from now on

01:03:18.103 --> 01:03:19.938
it means that I love you.

01:03:32.951 --> 01:03:34.953
Subtitles by Eunsook Youn
and Jennifer Lim
